      "Source": "Eat it to gain a tiny amount of nourishment, or plant it to grow your own Rare Mushrooms.  Can be planted in Small, Medium, or Large Crop Plots.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"食用可获得少量营养，或种植以培育自己的稀有蘑菇。可种植在小型、中型或大型作物田中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2823713889",
      "Source": "Eat it to gain a tiny amount of nourishment, or plant it to grow your own tiny Redwood Tree to collect sap from.  Can be planted in Small, Medium, or Large Crop Plots.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"食用可获得少量营养，或种植以培育自己的小型红杉树来收集树液。可种植在小型、中型或大型作物田中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3968805924",
      "Source": "Eat it to gain a tiny amount of nourishment, or plant it to grow your own Silk bush.  Can be planted in Small, Medium, or Large Crop Plots.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"食用可获得少量营养，或种植以培育自己的丝绸灌木。可种植在小型、中型或大型作物田中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1230863337",
      "Source": "Spoils meat at increased rate and makes Spoiled meat last longer. Hold Ctrl+T while hovering over meat to add them in very quickly without stacking!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"加速肉类腐坏，并延长腐肉的保存时间。将鼠标悬停在肉类上时按住Ctrl+T，可快速添加且不堆叠！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::329203844",
      "Source": "Automatically generates honey over time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"随时间自动生成蜂蜜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2999166436",
      "Source": "Refrigerates materials and Requires only Power to be activated. Must have Control Console Nearby for Pulling to work.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"冷藏材料，仅需电力即可激活。必须靠近控制控制台才能启用抽取功能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::163079397",
      "Source": "Grind resources into new items with OCD Pulling!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通过OCD抽取将资源研磨成新物品！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1794606735",
      "Source": "An advanced automation core that acts as the ultimate catalyst for your Gacha operations. This structure seizes control of chance, managing everything from Gacha happiness and feeding to the automated collection, cracking, and high-fidelity sorting of crystal loot directly into your vaults.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个先进的自动化核心，是你嘎查运营的终极催化剂。该结构掌控概率，管理从嘎查的幸福感和喂食到水晶战利品的自动收集、破解以及高保真分类并直接存入保险柜的所有环节。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3793915289",
      "Source": "Grind ANY gem down into this crystal that is indistiguishable from regular crystal.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将任何宝石研磨成这种与普通水晶无法区分的水晶。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1566329086",
      "Source": "Your typical grinder, but with a grind all button. It can Grinds Ingots into raw metal, and can use Electricity! The Grinder has OCD Sorting in it, so be sure to set all your junk to pull to the grinder!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你常见的研磨机，但带有“全部研磨”按钮。它可以将锭研磨成原金属，还能使用电力！该研磨机内置OCD分类功能，所以一定要将所有杂物设置为抽取到研磨机！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1237372676",
      "Source": "Can use Electricity or Gas to operate. Pulls raw metal from nearby dinos. Crafting speed set by ini",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可使用电力或汽油运行。从附近恐龙身上抽取原金属。制作速度由ini设置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2595200970",
      "Source": "Burns Wood Fast, use Sparkpowder instead. Balances Metal between forges. Pull smetal from nearby dinos only!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"快速燃烧木材，改用引火粉。平衡熔炉之间的金属。仅从附近恐龙身上抽取金属！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::588552110",
      "Source": "Put food for your nearby pets in this, and they'll automatically eat it when hungry! Can refridgerate items, and has auto balancing.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将附近宠物的食物放在这里，它们饿的时候会自动吃！可冷藏物品，且具备自动平衡功能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4202467953",
      "Source": "Craft everything here with Auto Pulling! Must have Control Console nearby for pulling to function!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通过自动抽取在这里制作所有物品！必须靠近控制控制台才能启用抽取功能！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::384390091",
      "Source": "Works as Fabricator, has auto pull. Crafting speed is faster by default, speed is ini config. Must have Control Console nearby for pulling to function!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"作为机床使用，具备自动抽取功能。默认制作速度更快，速度由ini配置。必须靠近控制控制台才能启用抽取功能！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3892301415",
      "Source": "This Thing Sucks! Picks up everything off the ground for your Control Console to sort! Yes, it works for earthquakes! Picks up owl pellets and distributes them evenly to nearby Gachas!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这东西超好用！捡起地面上的所有物品供你的控制控制台分类！没错，它能应对地震！捡起雪鸮呕吐物并均匀分配给附近的嘎查！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2638665140",
      "Source": "Stores Anything, Must have Control Console nearby for OCD Pulling to function!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"存储任何物品，必须靠近控制控制台才能启用OCD抽取功能！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3129409265",
      "Source": "Converts Polymer between Hard and Soft with the use of strong chemicals.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用强化学物质将聚合物在硬和软之间转换。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2631185317",
      "Source": "Has OCD Pulling and has a button to manually delete anything inside of it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"具备OCD抽取功能，且有一个按钮可手动删除内部的任何物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3992594735",
      "Source": "Fill with wood and/or sparkpowder. It will fill all Standing Torches in the area and keep them balanced",
      "Trans": {"SC":"填入木材和/或引火粉。它会填充该区域的所有立式火把并保持平衡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1370894944",
      "Source": "This is used to craft all Automated Ark Items. Must have Control Console nearby for pulling to function!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"用于制作所有自动化方舟物品。必须靠近控制控制台才能启用抽取功能！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1055124204",
      "Source": "Feed this to a baby dino right after claiming it to instantly imprint the dino.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在认领幼崽后立即喂给它，可立即印记该恐龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2932352829",
      "Source": "Must contain Gasoline.  Has a balance feature to balance gas to nearby generators evenly",
      "Trans": {"SC":"必须装入汽油。具备平衡功能，可将汽油均匀分配给附近的发电机。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::951196166",
      "Source": "Uses the gunpowder of the bullets in the bin to Distribute ammo to all nearby turrets. Consumes a few bullets on each use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用箱中子弹的火药将弹药分配给所有附近的炮塔。每次使用会消耗几发子弹。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::95109983",
      "Source": "Works like all other OCD structures. Put berries or veggies inside and add them to the pulling list to start the OCD Pulling!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"与所有其他OCD结构的工作方式相同。放入浆果或蔬菜并将它们添加到抽取列表中，即可启动OCD抽取！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::784576635",
      "Source": "Fungal Tree",
      "Trans": {"SC":"真菌树","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    }
  ]
}